# Plugin test fixtures are DELIBERATELY committed, and several of them are
# named exactly like build output: a make-generic fixture needs a real
# Makefile, a cmake fixture may want a CMakeCache.txt, a rust fixture a
# target/ stub. The rules above would silently swallow them — `git add` would
# report nothing wrong and the plugin's tests would fail only for the next
# person to clone. Unignore the whole fixture tree.
!plugins/*/tests/fixtures/**
